{"type":"standard","title":"Charlie Hatcher","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Charlie Hatcher</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q140928033","titles":{"canonical":"Charlie_Hatcher","normalized":"Charlie Hatcher","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Charlie Hatcher</span></span>"},"pageid":83552934,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1372771003","tid":"611b31a9-a68c-11f1-8110-804c519992b5","timestamp":"2026-09-02T05:08:48Z","description":"American politician (born 1958)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlie_Hatcher","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlie_Hatcher?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlie_Hatcher?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Charlie_Hatcher"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlie_Hatcher","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Charlie_Hatcher","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlie_Hatcher?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Charlie_Hatcher"}},"extract":"Charles Woodbridge Hatcher is an American dairy farmer who is the Republican Party nominee for Tennessee's 5th congressional district in the 2026 general election. He defeated incumbent U.S. representative Andy Ogles in the Republican primary in an upset race. He previously served as the commissioner of the Tennessee Department of Agriculture from 2019 to 2025.","extract_html":"<p><b>Charles Woodbridge Hatcher</b> is an American dairy farmer who is the Republican Party nominee for Tennessee's 5th congressional district in the 2026 general election. He defeated incumbent U.S. representative Andy Ogles in the Republican primary in an upset race. He previously served as the commissioner of the Tennessee Department of Agriculture from 2019 to 2025.</p>"}